  "notes": "{変|へん} is a na-adjective meaning strange or odd.\n\nFORMS:\n- {変|へん}な + noun: strange (attributive)\n- {変|へん}だ/です: is strange (predicate)\n- {変|へん}に: strangely (adverb)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {変|へん}な{音|おと}: strange sound\n- {変|へん}な{味|あじ}: weird taste\n- {変|へん}だな: That's strange (casual reflection)\n- {何|なに}か{変|へん}: something is off\n\nRELATED KANJI READINGS:\nThe kanji {変|へん} also appears in:\n- {変|か}える (to change something)\n- {変|か}わる (to change, intransitive)\n- {変化|へんか} (change, transformation)",
